@ 6.2.2.1.17 - Classical Arabic to Tunisian Arabic
# citation: Pogostick Man
	a > ɑ
	a > ɛ (sometimes)
	{ dˤ, q } > { ðˤ, {ɡ,q} }
	{ d͡ʒ, x, ɣ } > { ʒ, χ, ʁ }
	aj aw > aj, e:[+long], i:[+long] aw, o:[+long], u:[+long]
	V:[+long] > V:[-long] / _# (except as below)
	{ V, V:[+long] } > V:[+long] / in accented or stressed monosyllables